OVERVIEW
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
This LICENSE governs the use, reproduction, modification, distribution, and publication of all source code, scripts, documentation, models, datasets, outputs, visualizations, and other associated files (collectively referred to as "OmicsCL") contained within this repository. The contents are the exclusive intellectual property of Atahan Karagöz.

OmicsCL is a research-grade software project developed for academic study in the field of machine learning and computational biology, with a specific focus on unsupervised representation learning from multi-omics data. It includes novel architectural designs, survival-aware contrastive loss functions, preprocessing techniques, model training pipelines, and evaluation scripts that collectively form a modular, end-to-end system for cancer subtype discovery.

This license is NOT an open-source license. This repository is made publicly visible solely to demonstrate reproducibility of published research, and to allow other researchers to evaluate the results and methodology under strict conditions of non-use without permission.

